      "writtenOn": "2023-02-13T18:41:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see -- so modifying just that file is sufficient to build all Skia sources in C++20 in Chromium?\n\nFor context, Chromium is moving to C++20 imminently, so adding a C++20 builder in Skia upstream probably makes sense, as otherwise any incompatibilities that land will halt the autoroller. For now, I\u0027ll abandon this change and simply fix any compile incompatibilities that currently occur (I didn\u0027t see any locally).",
      "parentUuid": "bb939ecb_fcc4f5ea",
